/****************************************************************************
 * Name: nxmutex_get_holder
 *
 * Description:
 *   This function get the holder of the mutex referenced by 'mutex'.
 *   Note that this is inherently racy unless the calling thread is
 *   holding the mutex.
 *
 * Parameters:
 *   mutex - mutex descriptor.
 *
